": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "hash": "33f53793bcb615e04142dd6497ab04920adc3b396123979f0ade3fa2a45ce3f4", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Victims are tricked into disclosing personal information or downloading malware.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 80, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "888f8ae4-cbb8-4c39-9bc5-c3158674ce6f": {"__data__": {"id_": "888f8ae4-cbb8-4c39-9bc5-c3158674ce6f", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"id": "phishing_3", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "87487415-bff9-4610-89ba-6d47849c2f5a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"id": "phishing_3", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "hash": "ed2f3bb19a7d85f5ae0ef8abb4a1b0a4b2a28623dea54117e607126d7fa99df5", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Scenarios:\n- Scenario 1: Emails impersonating high-ranking executives accuse victims of crimes to coerce them into revealing information or opening malware-laden attachments.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 174, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "7970840e-3e13-46ab-9950-c17ca393a70b": {"__data__": {"id_": "7970840e-3e13-46ab-9950-c17ca393a70b", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"id": "phishing_4", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "8152903b-8994-48f1-8481-be55b47dc648", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"id": "phishing_4", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "hash": "19a5e4f9a0c1598a66b33c9f0547c4a920bede9c792f8efdee93d5f4140db9ff", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "- Scenario 2: Emails/SMS from fake banks or authorities alert victims of data breaches, directing them to spoofed websites to input credentials.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 144, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "766b3737-a942-4f69-a44e-4c39560a75a3": {"__data__": {"id_": "766b3737-a942-4f69-a44e-4c39560a75a3", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"id": "phishing_5", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b84f59d1-6604-47fe-b6b4-bc1b7a5ae8e2", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"id": "phishing_5", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "hash": "6efee41f4f15958e35f922f68fe7afc89ac0a6da29d8fdbdaa81376b3a29230a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "- Scenario 3: SMS messages deliver disguised malware apps that harvest sensitive data.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 86, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "88ddf07c-fe94-40a3-9362-6a46fba6f5b3": {"__data__": {"id_": "88ddf07c-fe94-40a3-9362-6a46fba6f5b3", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"id": "phishing_6", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "9f2efd27-7895-42e9-a7db-06562dbe100c", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"id": "phishing_6", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Email Phishing-Smishing", "lang": "en"}, "hash": "9e2e96f2622e8618c7bed4bcf05c711f42c349a8b4c7debc95df7f67e3747196", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "- Scenario 4: SMS links lead to pharming sites that mimic trusted brands and steal login data through fake pop-ups.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 115, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "febfba0e-390a-49a4-9564-d9ca7ccb279f": {"__data__": {"id_": "febfba0e-390a-49a4-9564-d9ca7ccb279f", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"id": "phishing_7", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Man-in-the-Middle Attack", "lang": "en"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "7340258c-3d91-4a6e-b3fd-76ad9942b918", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"id": "phishing_7", "source": "Phishing Scenarios", "doc_type": "explainer", "title": "Man-in-the-Middle Attack", "lang": "en"}, "hash": "de9002413758e07f15c4f999341565d26a057761c3e7b43fd92db10eb96b67a6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "An attacker intercepts communication between a victim and a trusted entity, often using email spoofing.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 103, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "441e53f7-ec3d-44ef-a386-c7ff98b0fbf1": {"__data__": {"id_": "441e53f7-ec3d-44ef-a386-c7ff98b0fbf1", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"id": "phishing_8", 